<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="CH7x2014-en-ad254cbf" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of  into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#CH7x2014"><title xml:lang="och"/></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-03-24T00:20:24.505+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="CH7x2014-start"><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.223" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Bào Jìng cooked stones to relieve hunger.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.224" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">The *Book of Jin* states:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.225" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Bào Jìng was the Governor of Nánhǎi.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.226" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Once, when he was inspecting his territory,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.227" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">he went into the sea and encountered a storm.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.228" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">He was extremely hungry,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.229" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">so he took white stones, cooked and ate them to sustain himself.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.230" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">(One recalls) Jiāng Gōng, who retreated from the world.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.231" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">The *Biographies of Eminent Scholars* states:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.232" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Jiāng Gōng was invited to government office ten times,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.233" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">and recommended as a man of virtue nine times,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.234" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">but he accepted none of them.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.235" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">During the reign of Emperor Líng,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.236" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Cáo Jié reported to the Emperor and summoned Gōng.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.237" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Gōng concealed himself and evaded the imperial summons,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.238" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">drifting on a raft into the sea.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.239" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">(One recognizes) Zhòngní (Confucius) who spoke of riding a raft.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.240" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">The *Analects*:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.241" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">The Master said:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.242" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">"If the Way does not prevail,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.243" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">I will get on a raft and float on the sea."</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.244" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Now, observing the control of the clear and the leading of the turbid,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.245" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Emperor Jiǎnwén of Liang's *Rhapsody on the Sea* states:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.246" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">The virtue of *kǎn* (water) ceaselessly accumulates,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.247" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">water sources are deep and vast.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.248" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">It flows into all rivers,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.249" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">controlling the clear and leading the turbid,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.250" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">beginning from an overflowing cup,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.251" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">and finally emptying into the great ocean.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.252" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Sweeping the clouds and bathing the sun,</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.253" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Mù Xuánxū's *Rhapsody on the Sea* states:</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.254" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Vast and surging (the waters),</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.255" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">sweeping the clouds and bathing the sun.</seg><seg corresp="#CH7x2014_CHANT_007-2a.256" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-03-24T00:20:59.997+09:00">Looking at those young children,</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>